#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Shell command template. Available placeholders: {trial_dir}, {log_path}, {n_gpu}, "
"{n_core}, {ntomp}, {ntmpi}, {gpu_ids}"
msgstr ""
"shell command "
"template。利用可能なplaceholder：{trial_dir}、{log_path}、{n_gpu}、{n_core}、{ntomp}、{ntmpi}、{gpu_ids}"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Base mdrun command. If {log_path} or {ntomp} are missing, '-g {log_path}' and '-ntomp "
"{ntomp}' are appended automatically. '-ntmpi {ntmpi}' is appended only for thread-MPI "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"base mdrunコマンド。{log_path}または{ntomp}がない場合は'-g {log_path}'と'-ntomp "
"{ntomp}'を自動追加する。'-ntmpi {ntmpi}'はthread-MPI modeでのみ追加する"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Optional MPI launcher template prepended to --mdrun-command, for example 'mpirun -np "
"{ntmpi}' or 'srun --ntasks {ntmpi} --cpus-per-task {ntomp}'."
msgstr ""
"--mdrun-commandの前に付ける任意のMPI launcher template。例：'mpirun -np {ntmpi}'または'srun --ntasks "
"{ntmpi} --cpus-per-task {ntomp}'"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid ""
"MPI style. auto treats --mpi-launcher as external MPI and otherwise uses thread-MPI."
msgstr "MPI方式。autoでは--mpi-launcher指定時は外部MPI、それ以外はthread-MPIを使用する"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Log file name generated by each trial"
msgstr "各trialが生成するlogファイル名"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Working directory for trial subdirectories"
msgstr "trial subdirectory用の作業ディレクトリ"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Optuna sampler"
msgstr "Optuna sampler"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Random seed for Optuna samplers"
msgstr "Optuna samplerの乱数seed"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Number of trials. Defaults to full search for grid, otherwise 20"
msgstr "trial数。gridではデフォルトで全探索、それ以外は20"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Candidate numbers of GPUs (use 0 for CPU-only trials)"
msgstr "GPU数の候補（CPUのみのtrialは0）"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Candidate numbers of CPU cores. Not appended to mdrun automatically; use {n_core} or "
"MDTBX_N_CORE in launcher/helper scripts if needed."
msgstr ""
"CPU core数の候補。mdrunには自動追加されないため、必要ならlauncher/helper scriptで{n_core}またはMDTBX_N_COREを使用する"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Candidate OpenMP thread counts"
msgstr "OpenMP thread数の候補"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
msgid "Candidate MPI rank counts"
msgstr "MPI rank数の候補"

#: ../../../<autoprogram>:1
